      "quantifier": "all"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Subnet AZs and /26 CIDRs checked by behaviour (distinct values), not by name. A /26 written as an unresolved Fn::Cidr fails cidr_slash26, accepted because the prompt asks for configurable blocks. Which subnet a NAT route's table serves cannot be chained across resources; private_nat_routes requires distinct route tables and distinct NAT gateways, and assocs requires four distinct subnets."
}
